# candle data
# 395 MB of MT5 CSV exports, one file per timeframe. Deliberately NOT in the
# repo: XAUUSDm_M1_5years.csv alone is 138 MB, which GitHub rejects outright
# (hard limit 100 MB/file). On a server they live outside the app directory and
# are found through CANDLE_DATA_DIR — see DEPLOY.md.
/candle_data/

# playwright-mcp scratch output
/.playwright-mcp/
